Dear Riya Bhatt,

Rutvik Chauhan has asked us to register your firm as a supplier to Ashvaka Ce=
ment and Building Materials Limited for scaffolding and formwork hire. Please=
 reply to this email with the following documents:

1. GST registration certificate (Form GST REG-06) for the state you will supp=
ly from
2. PAN of the vendor entity
3. Cancelled cheque with the account holder's name printed, or a bank letter =
signed and stamped by the bank
4. Partnership deed (first pages and signature page)
5. Udyam registration certificate (you have declared MSME status)
6. ISO 45001 certificate
7. Insurance certificate (employees' compensation or contractor's cover)

Copies must be clear and complete.

